  "feedbacks": [],
  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 11 actions (src/actions.js, one setActionDefinitions call). The feedback file (src/feedbacks.js) registers an empty definition set (the only feedback is commented out), so there are no feedbacks.",
    "Protocol: HTTP GET requests to the Hippotizer REST API on port 40512 (src/requests.js), for Hippotizer 4.7.1 or later with the REST API component added to the show (companion/HELP.md). Pin paths are written with underscores, for example Engine_Mix1_Layer1.",
    "The media or preset id sent for layer and mix loads is bank * 256 + slot (src/utils.js). Layer load media with Autoplay loads the clip, fades the layer level up and fades it out after the clip length minus one second (or after the image timeout for stills; src/commands.js).",
    "The fade type ids of layer_load_preset_on are strings 0 to 5 and the layer_play_modes ids are strings 0 to 10; labels are recorded as in the source.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.11.3: options do not support expressions."
  ]
